Work done so far.

Django app (On this machine)
Postgres (On docker container) 5433
Kafka (On docker container)
Kafka UI (On docker container)
More info in docker compose file
To run:

docker compose up -d  # This makes postgres, kafka and its ui UP an Running.
python manage.py runserver 127.0.0.1:8001

docker compose down

Hit this curl.

curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/orders/ \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "customer": "3ba8f8e8-3a87-4b32-8194-eab85a81c2d4",
    "items": [
      {
        "product": "64da52ff-7c52-447b-bfff-f11d7ef1ab88",
        "quantity": 2,
        "price": "100.00"
      },
      {
        "product": "3cdf7e1a-7555-47b4-8b33-fe9c2cc616f5",
        "quantity": 1,
        "price": "200.00"
      }
    ]
  }'


  What will happen:
  Order is created in DB.
  Mesage is published on kafka with some topic name.